# No day-plan ticket

There is no day planner. Markets and stalls use **Save** (`SaveButton`) only. Do not add plus stamps, punch controls, “Add to ticket”, overlays, hints, or localStorage for a visit plan.

```tsx
// BAD
<DayPlanPlus hall={hall} />
<span>Add to ticket</span>

// GOOD
<SaveButton kind="market" slug={market.slug} name={market.name} />
```

The sign-in overlay (`GuestSignInSlip`) is a different surface. `bg-ticket` / `--ticket` is the plate color, not this feature. Inbox week mail (`EmailVisitButton`) is also separate — do not rebuild it as a ticket.
